description	"Satele Shan

A force enhanced Jedi with high telekinetic powers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Staff)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- BP Free Jumps
-- 18% longer
-- 25% less Purple damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Repulse ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)"